    "https://jobs.lse.ac.uk/Vacancies/W/3772/0/475572/15539/head-of-randi-assessment-and-intelligence": {
      "title": "Head of R&I Assessment & Intelligence",
      "description": "Head of R&I Assessment & Intelligence Register Login Back to search results Head of R&I Assessment & Intelligence LSE is committed to building a diverse, equitable and truly inclusive university Research & Innovation Head of R&I Assessment & Intelligence Salary from ££63,370 to ££73,163 pa inclusive with potential to progress to ££80,927 pa inclusive of London allowance LSE is a leading social science institution with huge global impact. Our researchers are world-leading thinkers on critical issues, and our mission is to know the causes of things for the betterment of society. LSE Research and Innovation helps to develop and sustain an environment that makes LSE the best place in the world to do excellent and impactful social science research. The R&I Assessment & Intelligence team brings together a multi-faceted service that aims to help understand, reflect and advise on the changing internal and external expectations on LSE for its research and innovation activities. This includes the provision of research intelligence to improve LSE’s ability to respond to the external environment, strengthening research excellence and preparing for institutional exercises such as the REF assessment exercise, overseeing the management of allocated block funding and the subsequent infrastructure around the optimum use of internal funding, and engaging with senior stakeholders to support institutional decision-making. The postholder will provide senior professional leadership for the team, ensuring that its work is coherent, well governed and translated into clear timely strategic advice, effective delivery and practical support for senior institutional decision-making and successful performance delivery against LSE ambitions and priorities. Candidates should have: Senior leadership experience in a research-intensive environment, including leading institutional preparations for REF. Expertise in research intelligence, quantitative and qualitative analysis, evaluation and critical thinking, including the responsible use of AI, to inform senior decision-making. Excellent written, oral and interpersonal skills, with the ability to communicate complex or sensitive information clearly and build effective relationships with senior stakeholders. Strong strategic planning, collaboration and change-management skills, including establishing effective governance, workplans, resource plans, risk controls and progress monitoring. A proven commitment to high-quality service delivery, with experience of improving integrated services, systems, processes, communications and knowledge management through innovative problem-solving. We offer an occupational pension scheme, generous annual leave, hybrid working, and excellent training and development opportunities. For further information about the post, please see the how to apply document , job description and the person specification . To apply for this post, please go to www.jobs.lse.ac.uk . If you have any technical queries with applying on the online system, please use the “contact us” links at the bottom of the LSE Jobs page. Should you have any queries about the role, please email g.mcconnell@lse.ac.uk . The closing date for receipt of applications is 15 th November 2026 (23.59 UK time). Regrettably, we are unable to accept any late applications. Apply now Back to search results Head of R&I Assessment & Intelligence Job Type: Professional Services Posted: 09/10/2026 Closing date: 15/11/2026 Closing time: 23:59 (GMT) Apply now Save Share Login Register Email Address: Please enter a valid email address. Password: Sign in Forgot password? Your password has expired, please create a new password below. Your email address has not been verified. Please check your email or click here to resend. Verification email has been resent. Email Address: Please enter a valid email address. Reset password Cancel Email Address: New Password: At least 8 characters Uppercase Lowercase Symbols Numbers Confirm Password: Update Password Your login attempt was not successful. Please try again Please select Baroness Baron Doctor Father Lady Lord Miss Mr Mrs Ms Professor Dame Professor Professor Lord Professor Sir Reverend Sir Other Dame Mx Title * First name * Last name * Email address * Password * At least 8 characters Uppercase Lowercase Symbols Numbers Confirm password * I have read and understood the terms and conditions I have read and understood the data protection statement Create Account Cancel An email has been sent to your email address. Please confirm that your email address is active by clicking the link in the email. Powered by engage|ats Havas People a Havas Company This site is protected by reCAPTCHA. Contact Us - Application Query Terms and Conditions Privacy Policy Cookies Accessibility FAQs By clicking “Accept All Cookies”, you agree to the storing of cookies on your device to enhance site navigation, analyze site usage, and assist in our marketing efforts. View our privacy policy Cookies Settings Reject All Accept All Cookies Privacy Preference Center When you visit any website, it may store or retrieve information on your browser, mostly in the form of cookies. This information might be about you, your preferences or your device and is mostly used to make the site work as you expect it to. The information does not usually directly identify you, but it can give you a more personalized web experience. Because we respect your right to privacy, you can choose not to allow some types of cookies. Click on the different category headings to find out more and change our default settings. However, blocking some types of cookies may impact your experience of the site and the services we are able to offer. Allow All Manage Consent Preferences Strictly Necessary Services Always Active These Services are necessary for the website to function and cannot be switched off in our systems. They are usually only set in response to actions made by you which amount to a request for services, such as setting your privacy preferences, logging in or filling in forms. You can set your browser to block or alert you about these cookies, but some parts of the site will not then work. Functional Services Functional Services With these services, the website is able to provide advanced functionality and personalization. They may be set by us or by third parties whose services we use on our sites. If you do not allow these services, this website may not function properly. Back Button Cookie List Search Icon Filter Icon Clear checkbox label label Apply Cancel Consent Leg.Interest checkbox label label checkbox label label checkbox label label Reject All Confirm My Choices 1 Technical Support Today New Messages Technical Support Chatbot (with creds) a few seconds ago Welcome to Technical Support. Please could you let us know whether you're a candidate or a recruiter? Candidate Recruiter ⚡ by Freshworks 1"
