    "https://jobs.lse.ac.uk/Vacancies/W/2154/0/475147/15539/hr-administrator-review-and-promotion-part-time-0-5fte": {
      "title": "HR Administrator, Review and Promotion (part time 0.5FTE)",
      "description": "HR Administrator, Review and Promotion (part time 0.5FTE) Register Login Back to search results HR Administrator, Review and Promotion (part time 0.5FTE) LSE is committed to building a diverse, equitable and truly inclusive university Human Resources Division HR Administrator, Review and Promotion (part time 0.5FTE) Salary from £32,890 (£16,445 at 0.5FTE) to £36,052 (£18,026 at 0.5FTE) pa inclusive with potential to progress to £38,442 (£19,221 at 0.5FTE) pa inclusive of London allowance The London School of Economics and Political Science (LSE) is one of the foremost social sciences universities in the world specialising in Social Sciences. The HR Division provides advice and support to the School and its diverse customer base of over 4,000 employees. We are currently looking for a proactive individual to join our busy team dedicated to providing the best customer service to our users. The Review and Promotion team sits within the larger HR Operations function and is responsible for effective, high-quality Human Resources services to staff through the management of various School committees. The HR Administrator role will appeal to you if you have an interest in the higher education sector, excellent organisational skills and strong communication skills. You will be instrumental in providing support to the team and the School’s employees during a time of change both within the HR Division and in the wider School. For this role you will also need to be a strong self-motivator with excellent IT skills and a positive customer services ethos. You will have a supportive team around you but you will need to be versatile, adaptable, resilient and solutions-focused. As an effective relationship builder, you will be comfortable working within a complex, changing environment with the ability to thrive under pressure. The HR Division is currently working on improving processes and systems in the function to considerably optimise the customer journey. There will be an opportunity for this role to be creative and forward-thinking in partaking in process improvements in their area of expertise to make a significant difference in the service experience. This is an exciting opportunity to develop and enhance your current skills and experience in Human Resources. We welcome your application. We offer an occupational pension scheme, generous annual leave and excellent training and development opportunities. For further information about the post, please see the how to apply document , job description and the person specification . To apply for this post, please go to www.jobs.lse.ac.uk . If you have any technical queries with applying on the online system, please use the “contact us” links at the bottom of the LSE Jobs page. Should you have any queries about the role, please email n.kalghatgi@lse.ac.uk . The closing date for receipt of applications is Thursday 15 October 2026 (23.59 UK time). Regrettably, we are unable to accept any late applications. Apply now Back to search results HR Administrator, Review and Promotion (part time 0.5FTE) Job Type: Professional Services Posted: 01/10/2026 Closing date: 15/10/2026 Closing time: 23:59 (BST) Apply now Save Share Login Register Email Address: Please enter a valid email address. Password: Sign in Forgot password? Your password has expired, please create a new password below. Your email address has not been verified. Please check your email or click here to resend. Verification email has been resent. Email Address: Please enter a valid email address. Reset password Cancel Email Address: New Password: At least 8 characters Uppercase Lowercase Symbols Numbers Confirm Password: Update Password Your login attempt was not successful. Please try again Please select Baroness Baron Doctor Father Lady Lord Miss Mr Mrs Ms Professor Dame Professor Professor Lord Professor Sir Reverend Sir Other Dame Mx Title * First name * Last name * Email address * Password * At least 8 characters Upp